---
import SiteShell from "../layouts/SiteShell.astro";
---
<SiteShell title="Inference credit | Outfitter" description="Manage your Outfitter inference credit.">
  <main class="billing">
    <h1>Inference credit</h1>
    <p>Choose your personal account or an organization you own. Purchased credit stays with that account.</p>
    <p id="billing-status" role="status">Loading your accounts…</p>
    <form id="billing-form" hidden>
      <label>Account <select id="billing-account" required></select></label>
      <p id="billing-balance"></p>
      <label>Credit in USD <input id="billing-amount" type="number" min="5" max="1000" step="0.01" value="20" required /></label>
      <button id="billing-buy" type="submit" disabled>Buy credit</button>
    </form>
    <form id="spending-form" hidden>
      <h2>Monthly paid usage</h2>
      <label><input id="spending-enabled" type="checkbox" /> Enable paid inference</label>
      <label><input id="spending-uncapped" type="checkbox" /> Allow uncapped paid usage</label>
      <label>Monthly maximum in USD <input id="spending-limit" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="20" /></label>
      <p>Free partner credit is additional. Uncapped usage still requires prepaid credit.</p>
      <button type="submit">Save spending limit</button>
    </form>
    <form id="topup-form" hidden>
      <h2>Automatic credit purchases</h2>
      <p id="topup-status" role="status"></p>
      <label>Buy credit when available paid balance is below USD <input id="topup-threshold" type="number" min="0" max="999.99" step="0.01" value="5" required /></label>
      <label>Purchase amount in USD <input id="topup-amount" type="number" min="5" max="1000" step="0.01" value="20" required /></label>
      <label><input id="topup-consent" type="checkbox" required /> I authorize Outfitter to save my card and charge this purchase amount automatically when my selected account needs credit, until I disable automatic purchases.</label>
      <p>Monthly usage limits apply to inference consumed, not card charges. Credit purchases may exceed the month's remaining usage limit. Pending charges may complete after disabling.</p>
      <button id="topup-save" type="submit">Save card and enable automatic purchases</button>
      <button id="topup-disable" type="button">Disable automatic purchases</button>
      <button id="topup-reconcile" type="button">Check pending payment</button>
    </form>
    <p>Payment confirmation can take a moment. Returning from Checkout does not confirm that credit has arrived.</p>
    <a href="/dashboard/">Back to dashboard</a>
  </main>
</SiteShell>
<style>
  .billing { max-width: 44rem; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 1.5rem; }
  form { display: grid; gap: 1rem; margin-block: 2rem; }
  form[hidden] { display: none; }
  label { display: grid; gap: .5rem; }
  select, input, button { font: inherit; padding: .7rem; }
</style>
<script>
  import "../scripts/billing-page";
</script>
